== Property Selection, Safety, and Accessibility Scoring

Every property offered through the corporate booking portal carries a score across six dimensions. The scoring is performed by the Travel Desk, drawing on traveler feedback, the Records Office's folio sampling, and publicly available certifications. Scores are refreshed whenever material information changes and at least as often as the directory review. Professionals choosing between two properties in the same city should prefer the higher-scoring one; where the scores are comparable, the property closer to the client site or transit wins.

